===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Phantump|16}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Tackle}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Phantump}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} Phantump.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

